# A Saga entering with two lore counters triggers both chapter I and chapter II (CR 714.3a, 714.2b, 122.6): Innkeeper's
# Talent at level 3 doubles the lore counter Fable of the Mirror-Breaker is given as it enters (CR 614.1c), so the count
# goes from none to two in one event and both chapters it passes trigger. Chapter I makes the Goblin Shaman; chapter II
# lets Bot1 discard the Island it drew this turn and draw the Swamp. The Talent's level-1 combat trigger has no creature
# to target on turn 1 and is removed.

[Bot1 Deck]
Forest
Sol Ring
Black Lotus
Innkeeper's Talent
